  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "黃帝所生，伏羲之宇。兵刃不至，利以居止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:13e7c04ada485fba0e5ca78802cce953256523a79dc07b66ce909ed21603730e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0728eb454efb8079e862cbd6d632c7c926d25214827a3c4cc629e4f649a0a35b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "登墀踒足，南行折角。長夜之室，不逄忠直。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:515de9a152a5752f1bdc1fdd2c1483f15736aa7aba7236d7ce053b1f185bc141",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b25e06ecf3e5ab83df0873e0449a9bf90c1f4b461366f54aa026c68594706e32"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "燕雀衰老，悲鳴入海。憂在不飾，差池其羽。頡頏上下，寡位獨處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f9c086bc6baa797d4a203f61757e3a70e3f973aefaac43485a41f2df6371402e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b2870d4dc69f7d9430106843fb6a29406559501b6614f9d98cd54afcaa9f302"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "關門除憂，伯自外來。切切之患，我心得歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7367a959e069dc04099797a0d0d1685f7dde258b79d83db68465438cb4a0e101",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9bf12543a5926d9cf7bac637781f8a0c0c64e5f7c75712c96de34c247eea62fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "郊耕擇耜，有所疑止。空虛無子，蒙昧不知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:571f476400adec9dbef7329d5ddc221f6deee7e76b1e4e8036d7163e210bad0e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2161ba36ad29ee956481aa4fb5be2b8549799aee7469c8c3f39ed4d9cd4bdfd1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "張牙切齒，斷怒相視。禍起蕭牆，牽引吾子。患不可解，憂驚吾母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f257cabd81d04ec953f8a83b3db35bbebd4bca97aacf9259352af5f53b069fca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7adaf4a6cde270466cabfd1fc7e0b3dd7a7c624f9f316859f7f204397c3fda48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "履不容足，南山多棘。毋出房閨，乃無病疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1493c3dc8c5b35bd24768aaccbbcfa6201bb225147a644ac84e117442508bc11",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a18767053af819cb6cfe83e41f19280c8de63e11fa28bbb9015a720296cd8884"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "牛騂亡子，鳴於大野。申后陰微，還歸其母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3472519af15a709d5cbd751dbeb8b100fb274452159dc151b475ad33a89452c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ea5971e45e9fa3d0a62dce790d54e639dc18e5f1fba70ab59bfd79a1c62d6cc9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "龍生于淵，因風昇天。章虎炳文，為禽敗軒。發輗溫谷，暮宿崑崙，終身無患。光精照耀，不被患難。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:44f3b9a842190afd2463fcd90c5bd01990b95e57b890183c31878ef827773118",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:35e635fe06f68ec80cc90ef3e4def3b4e9712b7f16e3f98d2681230dadd84349"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "既嫁宜吉，出入無咎。三聖並居，國安無災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:199358a07327ee2c742537278992c4a649bbbc291de328588425c5276b330254",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8a0839695e612bfc2b848340c27cc3301b7ed211e4c06a699ae618c2b71d050"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "北陸陽伏，不知黑白。君子傷讒，正害善人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b88e8aba7e963b1c73fb8499aa32de18e1dbebb992f9520a36c7a03a1ae5c68f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aed05d8fc08084d3f90f689511bf185a680de9ff592f16cdf706034714eb0b87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "一身兩頭，延適二家，亂不可治。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4c31e964bbf6789a226d86844a85210714319dfca35c157eadf8b88f8576de8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46a41f850c8da467f9064bbb4b9a8848bfbc9c6277a11974870cd40352952fcc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "牝馬牡駒，歲孳不休。君子衣服，利得有餘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42b573f8767edcf7b05c24857d67e19ba881c78550160bbc70e49f51c872e0e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5bfb98effd2b63c561909e5cd5f4931ffd7175dd677e59c7b318acfd4cd831b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "南行懷憂，破其金輿。安坐故廬，乃無殃患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2a55d6a6db370428789ab6b9e5b3a045f71e3191e55adfa579a13e1a2be76e0a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0f37c59a39ade8b54de23769cab812b1007e74718a8e51ec947d96401790932c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "憂人之患，履傷浮顏。為身禍殘，篤心自守。與喜相抱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0242cdc50b8732b1d03b2c079fdd5a3f693427a64acb963d5dac0005a31963c9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ceb80dcf83955f98e905bff560344c4443d482cc932ef4761571a12543a74fe5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "咸陽辰巳，長安戌亥。丘陵生心，非魚鰌市。可以避水，終無凶咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad9d827de25bc48e8da5e1d24e05e9fbef760f78d9cb9c0d3b2dfc4f217abbcd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fe6c3ed366962f7c39739a1c7bd13d4aff9e07967e01a0e938e462cce3058b83"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "不知何孫，夜來扣門。我慎外寇，兵戎且來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd86bbec0366d59b3ebda878355fe0988a92bbb5e8dd32bf0d03062ae1c67bd4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dc77b71107ddb6f565c018c1bd2a3c7c125b8108209ea0b7f01e05ea5998eb55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "昧旦不明，目暗無光。喪滅失常，使我心傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ffecefa1a549e38650806f24da1b1dee4d05e9c789376cf1e175713798bcdae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:95c48a151d9b791d4c7ac628df16ee0164903ac8ab090c5bc7ff0069380ef0c5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "江陰水側，舟楫破乏。狐不得南，豹無以北。雖欲會盟，河水梁絕。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ac5827577a4c422f8a34232ee59acfb0c8fa6500de73b692e9ee758b2d1900bb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f94f6507c000f2c6d518679b08871f2d642292e6135624a644d54120fce32b1f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "神之在丑，逆破為咎。不利西南，商人休止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:99a72d9d75e3b90f54538cc03a4d71e613c5f1ad9eebddb8ddd0d00e046e8195",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4f6fdf68de66b61270cd79db4808b6a8ca1588de7e3d404a894e2959dae32cd7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "然諾不行，欺訟誤人。使我虛宿，夜歸溫室。神怒不直，鬼擊無目。欲求福利，適反自賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64f7dda51f61523407494fe0026128a1e5fe2f672ee1b09e3a8a090e7f17bfad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:da0fc19972b233db75dc6c5fe55bbaf49145e1b8e2d1371b931253d45bd10774"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "攘臂拯肘，怒不可止。狼戾愎很，無與為市。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3728d0308c340567c525c18d09721ec0f97516db76697234258c522f4f0ea4e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09053bb81bbf4eeb688f47d6b329335f91832cb56a1574f6efec79562d156ddf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "販馬買牛，會值空虛。利得尟少，留連為憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb6e9edb34222bcb607591e36815456e28ef1258f72546a2234ed9e66faeef55",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:31535d40730ef5d6cc63fab57612771d74745912ab826f585660b61772f3901f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "高樓陸處，以避風雨。深堂邃宇，君安其所。牝雞之息，為我利福。請求弗得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:990a54171fa556deaa3b8fc50112b05bd2d85eeb0af3a42e49ab69c33ae05cb0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3f683b7e82063dbfd11613dca5652d4d16822a9015547f483ece6408f75eacca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "阿衡服箱，太乙載行。迯時歷舍，所求吉昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c16f622002d1a1c6ea299d21705294b2818f87c4516dcf9c20f15b5f6554114",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a87f74aca218e1b414774d23289a6b83679e1f2d6dddd14c9c716ef48a651e0d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "飛來之福，入我居室，以安吾國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:66218cee273e198f0afc0213d9f7c9c099acaf8ad3e59fcee4ab8120b2e5bbba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2646a10e15cafb3c616d919bdba135433431a116a8a721d8a12ba4c039d6fdaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "不孝之患，子孫為殘。老耄莫養，獨坐空垣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e5f17169b03cb1162cbd404ad607da66c5d1b0f9a17a08aa9d0862704a5fa2c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad8093c1d1e92978935d787241edbf9b18b45ceb98a3c5cb35f137400d242906"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "南過棘門，駒裂我冠。斷衣傷襦，使君恨憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42d2c02d976bf2a8e32690e926c7343c036e198793268bf424ac33adb9217bce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3146a136efa70f62b11fc24e8b2484f3b387b73d6ff54794c53b63acf44c55e5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "重門射平，不知所定。質疑蓍龜，孰可避火。明神答報，告以犧牲。宜利止居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:493f2bab497a1505bec48fe96ef4b722fe9312db6daa3c1778a1025f194496ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a257ed9754b9e3ef4712207c080ca9f410cd26dfb00a1f3632c2cea92cd6454"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "麟麑鳳雛，安樂無憂。捕魚河海，利踰徙居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eba09a9af64dc59fc890377d65c8fa03c37df8050593a7c64fbce12dfc28d3cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49128fe82836373d7743b307e2269c52497b3e2d163c64474263b34e6cb16e6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "新田宜粟，上農得穀。君子懷德，以干百祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c3b3eefdfce23d76920e79486c35906c4cdc600a639539a0cc8887a7e8c7a078",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf4a5ea7ad59d82978b3cfbb7c54b82943bc6ee44833cf3291ac7fb266e1de56"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "簪短帶長，出思苦窮。瘠蠡小瘦，以病之癃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a94edadf35974564c70c86e8746119c91076cf6628eb0a6852375b2c8ca63c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ef784ac0ead037e0ecf3e72fe6605fc045177b59bff31c36f41af0ae860d986"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "爭訟之門，不可與鄰。出入有為，憂生我患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dea40db596186c58be6daf7a7a28ab29af7a0454d5811ed3f03cb1a56f1345a9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:76d9061ae7fe1630f6726cee9c900f27f40192cea27a8b9dc6bd0bbb11a2b061"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "朽根枯株，不生肌膚。病在心腸，日以燋枯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:df517f8f76198b1a09009944d45b31b8513c7a8d8a86c673f991262b5e7c0fb6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:affdc9a7e99c8303f1c170500699d41cc5637dd11c2f12d96d2383a5d8b23180"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "雨師娶婦，黃巖季女。成禮就婚，相呼南上。膏我下土，年歲大茂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c559fc78e25d03a87ff3f7ed885b325d8b0cda8882ff93941a8d24e4b05ea3fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a6ba33fc40e4ca62bbb5c0e609728ee678f7bb058c4c0fd5b8697b90b4aa6bc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "冬採薇蘭，地凍堅難。利走失北，暮無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b9ea7fd5fa6838f7710105384f86a18190f92f7f6b6ba1a47194a8f2b66e81f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1233612199994f93a8db9aedd2303695a07e1316d8b24a87542515c834ff705d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "昧之東域，誤過虎邑。失我熟（一作熊）羆，飢無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:346c2112bc895d9b7239a5b62e8c19fb39561d7989210b8890155deb8b126a67",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2442383782124ccc3ea228c7555bcdaa9a4ba97fc511344edb34ded1cef64532"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "日莫閉目，隨陽休息。箕子以之，乃受其福。舉事多言，必為悔殘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40ba1c358f0acdea2264891d6ee7ffce8aef00bb232e0875f194e706edc19925",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba5b2c019e36132e61e8983d8d3be9fc9205ea9f41b70ae816a016c6797075b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "蓼蕭瀼瀼，君子龍光。鳴鸞噰噰，福祿來同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb917a10e511c8773d7b1c700d37e7791670127bd6108ca5f0cb240cc98b7b3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e7b7dae3310168786050b5b579f64d7939ceb7d1c23c220ddf333350d519c11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "鳥飛無翼，兔走折足。雖不同會，未能利達。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd3df1a1fe6481a8d67c1c38f5c353c754ef2e7d7012edc662e25f74e3630df0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7692444090e5f91b30406426110afce7cb7c32816864adc3fe023c657ebcb5fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "五勝相賊，火得水息。精光消滅，絕不能續。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05a7ab7b6841392bef778caad0e0271d9671c1cca3c8c089dd244ada46e3b4a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:880d0945ec96436ae234d25d444b02cb01f6ed8f3345f3748b0e397e16a42c20"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "東資齊魯，得騂大馬。便辟能言，市人善賈。鄰人併戶，請火不與。人道閉塞，鬼祟其宇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be434d0788c98043c2a8e66267281979218c22d9979facf093f705a228bc944f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71d4b33d09db41d6e3d1e1500651f0e3276005b3a388180653409a7be58944e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "爭雞失羊，亡其金囊。利不得長，陳蔡之患。賴楚以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e554af6fa250e910cb95dd633758725ebae98368be523658d107322f47c4d28e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:507cc11d637820eda05bd506f9bb2920a7bd40a256d9acceffb8ac6922179b1f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "九登十陟，馬跌不前。管子佐之，乃能上山。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:876417715b00c2a33c5c7e1e79564f6ecaeac086a5804fe979c81850fe2a66d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2530dc520feb25d6a364832fb7b614b83ab7a45dd5266e92c36f7d396d6e9a7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "東鄰愁苦，君亂天紀。日貪祿寵，必受其咎。一本有意合志同，內外相從，見吾伯公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e216f2987deecc7ae9a043ebbc04a21dee240cfc609602dae5b07bf2e3186e5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:154c691f214c297de85ff0ac6d262a000bfb2bddd03f2981b9e2bfe2edd21bc1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "三狸捕鼠，遮遏我前。死於壞域，不能脫走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b273099d22fc5aa75bbb794d9d1db2af6bfe9c071bf2e30f835973ce4682723c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e4a3e4a8fb805a88f361adcb5369b7f7de61e2c558c7b849f11d3aed3dfb6ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "狼虎爭彊，禮義不行。兼吞其國，齊魯無王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa0972a7e2713da0304806b5b08be0d9157b03db1ce31536010b02481152e035",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5012ecabb14a256b33ef898bc474950efa81070c852d266a48f70c7776ef6a25"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "五嶽四瀆，合潤為德。行不失理，民賴恩福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7a8a53ae86cd2dba2167b278c41161a5658e13500fe5f0cf89ef78196f5f916",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c38b746898674a018c8a7cdbca9c5249c0bdfc6c9f96a4ddc03525d73277d0b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "六月種黍，歲晚無雨。秋不宿酒，神失其所。先困後通，與福相從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02fee78a4fa26663bf85498e334de171c7a233e0641a63ab53f423dda4552849",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4b2e3062ac0beec4d792434749fbd6ee534a5db5a98491a3ebe486461cc8cab2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "騋牝龍身，日取三千。南上蒼梧，與福為婚。道理夷易，身安無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:707efaaaacba65b63fb4c7ac6d7b4aee687633d28220c349f33e91602ff2c3df",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:98a98b1befbe286cf966ec56a5b1cf645aedfa68facac5f34dbb9ae781057716"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "出入休居，安止無憂。上室之懽，虐為季殘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b44ce5c3ea31d3ae70ae14912e4a4e099bf94de8d7cf3e78fee1b677050876f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4036e46af81fc929c4191b702b26aa21a98dad36ccc94e689ef685b3cd12504b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "南山昊天，刺政閔身。疾病無辜，背憎為仇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:48005adb2eb05d169fcedf74359d55df6193b27ffdbe840b9140fa25d81abe8e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:84a4c5549b61eb47180c3543e2d7c62c549cf60250ec2c5a4b5ef7984a19fc28"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "潼頓東徙，道路跛踦。日辰不良，病為祟禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec0f0eef276a2b96791ffe13e646113d35baad65a7b87d9093b09f1d14059090",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c5cdbfca6add9ce310dd1a0af209db9047550ae056cb9d9e29699285f49394e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "兄征東燕，弟伐遼西。大克勝還，封居河間。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a46d0616d834ac9fcedd83fa53b360d71dcf95445e9ebaf6111305667ec3539",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01505cbb6a7fee92e6071b704c41af909f214813c100ef114315bff3afde63a3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "播輪折輻，馬不得行。豎牛之讒，賊其父兄。布衣不傷，終身無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:724e9ac102469d5e293ec70274cca40aab2ad2465bf4d942325ad4f9e9619a08",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd4882c989c2c1fb833c54ae7b2f94a0c9ab7a573cae62efc111e8aee69ffb17"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "駕之南海，晨夜不止。君子勞罷，僕夫憔苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a74415350cef16686981ed6a9de3a5e095a8c3f681ef8f6435c174a67dbcffc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27c065db028031dbae99cd7b4dc73c80e66b19db8f3d5d623fbc4153858b4a18"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "怨重被燒，忿怒生禍。褊心作事，意如為亂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e32e88c4553be32b3fa74986374ee80821890ec2a862df35bba2b689b376934d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:55b41b3f690db4058baea658adba367481aaa951d347761e13fa37b59a7c8c67"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "張狂妄行，竊食稻粱。狗吠非主，囓傷我足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c17a1b2a9f533ccdb91386117c134b08a979b9df5239b1ab494579b19a6e405b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:093d1da70ad138100f0e4e7cedd22dd401a5a5add4bbc21a0744131deb94320f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "驚蹕式道，先驅除咎。王后親桑，以率群功。安我祖宗。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:342bcbf1fb4141b4c65ee5d483e4f4211fc0aefba6384a3d1c49cfffd50191d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50cfaf8d893a7264577d1802a06257863bf145f13ce2e01dc6059d225bb5d1a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "門戶乏食，困死誰告。對門不通，安所歸急。積藏五穀，一花千葉，市賈有息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f164bb4dc9b0f773f42eff684b928fbd126ae2bbfaceea36db8925950fcf6c48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:82288b2102d3466eea954ba9b83a019fffda501164a856f982c8b76c6ce3ce6a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "破敝復完，危者得安。鄉善無損，商人有息。利來入門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a245463dbb1001272f39a32405b71f495e364438bf8a59659e794b59242fc2e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c94f6d96685ef2d57f4b5a18e26c31ec1932719342445967941108dd173306a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "疊疊累累，如岐之室。一息十子，古公治邑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d0e417573a48e98a55b133b12214e6ea74aed27b8298afafe35c7ab559d9554",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13b7b9ebf8612c6144e2971775e1702f829750a6457809bb8f9d4c7dab4dad66"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "三嫗治民，不勝其任。兩馬爭車，敗壞家室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:70e6402a2a26726fc276afb9ecb96c6f94939ed62633784148b94bd9235e4419",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:05ab9e608c8ff8dea26651027388b131396639d2eb603f11c9bd341dce842d02"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 32,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "蔽鏡無光，不見文章。少女不市，棄於相望。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bf50984e130d4d45b2c5db489a9a2cea3900a9d2fd88bfdf65d7dd29d589bac2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32e10388503eb35d4d03a57d853acecaedcf688b40cb3172a94448cf4ce06d1f"
    }
  ]
}
